<%- include('../layout/header', { title: 'Hearing Aid &#8211; Abid Hearing Care Centre', currentPath: '/hearing-aid', metaDesc: 'A hearing aid is a sophisticated miniature medical electronic device designed to amplify sound frequencies selectively.' }) %>

<div class="ct-container" style="padding: 40px 24px 70px;">
  <div style="font-family: inherit; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1 style="color: #0D529C; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px;">Modern Hearing Aids for a Modern World</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #475569;">
      A hearing aid is a sophisticated miniature medical electronic device designed to amplify sound frequencies selectively so that individuals with sensorineural or conductive hearing loss can listen, communicate, and participate fully in daily life.
    </p>

    <h2 style="color: #0D529C; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 32px;">Guidance by Patient Experience</h2>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;">
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #0D529C; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px;">
        <h3 style="color: #0D529C; margin-top: 0; font-size: 18px;">I have not worn hearing aids before</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 0;">
          On average, people wait 7 to 10 years after experiencing hearing difficulties before seeking help. During this time, the brain’s auditory cortex loses familiarity with high-frequency speech consonants. Modern digital devices are lightweight, automatic, and ease you gently into hearing clearly again.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #E53935; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px;">
        <h3 style="color: #E53935; margin-top: 0; font-size: 18px;">I have worn hearing aids before</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 0;">
          If your devices are more than 3-5 years old, modern platforms feature artificial intelligence noise cancellation, direct smartphone Bluetooth audio streaming, rechargeable lithium-ion batteries, and effortless speech tracking in crowded Bangladeshi gatherings.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
      <a href="/products" class="ahcc-btn-primary">Browse All Hearing Aids &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

